                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a surreal first person seated VR game inspired by Pac Man. I played for about 20 intense minutes. I enjoyed the game, the psichedelic effects and the overrall experience. I couldn't completely clean up the maze so i am not sure about the goal of the game, if there's an ending or it's just score attack. Again, for 2 Euros or less i reccomend to try this seated experience and have a laugh. There's clearly some potential so i reccomend the developers to add at least a couple of mazes as good as this one, with new tricks and traps.",
